{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8eadd4c9551d1bf5183321fbf51913bfe779df8d2999f854907a12800af412cf", "ja": "（海美はもう、レッスンは終わったかな。青羽さんと、\n新しい衣装の最終調整をしてもらいたいんだけど……）", "zh": "（海美已经练习完了吗？\n我想拜托青羽小姐帮她的新服装做最后的调整……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "beb72f04641658e06e1c231ebfc964079323deaadddc9b487f961296f85e3d70", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまーっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你工作辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1002_p", "source_sha256": "321f205ea6b318699a2a1af0c52b55beed79da27d413438efaf175d8b6739dd1", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま！\nあれ、その衣装は……。", "zh": "海美，你辛苦了！\n咦？那套服装是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "7ac3d0186f072fae0c457eb64577ab7e0bea8b8c0d945f7d7b6d4188a7367466", "ja": "うん！　レッスンが終わったら、\n衣装に着替えておいて～って、美咲ちゃんが！", "zh": "嗯！\n美咲叫我练习结束后就换上服装过来这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7e1dff0e104c848143dced1f46c8a32875df5a19b8f73517befcc60f0f67a1b", "ja": "でもまだ忙しいみたいだから、ここで待ってたんだ。\n{$P$}は？", "zh": "但她好像还在忙，所以我在这里等她。\n{$P$}呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "217ba23f1526b9f2e0a621c867a0b63a78fa4496ce07c23be4c1e5a4532536eb", "ja": "青羽さんと、同じ用事だよ。\nその衣装、着心地はどうだ？", "zh": "跟青羽小姐找你的目的一样。\n那套服装穿起来感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d9335e29b6a7041e790c82762f10d6674001a6938c8dbbaa790aef47ea59042", "ja": "もう、最高！　すっごくカワイイし、\nお花とかハートとか、女子力来た！って感じだよーっ☆", "zh": "超棒的！非常可爱，\n而且有花朵有爱心，感觉超有女子力喔──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "56099dee4dcaf5ce1819dc9060188eb8d9f74721ef9d56640e5e43f1e1d9693a", "ja": "あとね、この衣装でなら、\nすっごいダンスが踊れる気がする！", "zh": "还有呀，\n我觉得穿上这套服装可以跳出特别精采的舞蹈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "8437e433981a6706cf99c181d55fd37f2d2affb52ff2b167b662d7f884b20640", "ja": "脚も高く上げられるから、バレエのY字バランスだって\nできちゃうよ！　あ、今やってみせようか？", "zh": "因为可以把脚抬得很高，所以连芭蕾舞中让单脚垂直\n向上的动作都能做到喔！啊，我现在做给你看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6877bfb25dabf59919620897c11c8e05b1f04af8b0d667d83ca8d194e11aa37e", "ja": "いや、それはまた今度にしよう！\nいや今度というか……いろいろ準備してからな！", "zh": "不用了，下次再说吧！\n不对，与其说是下次……等做好各种准备后再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "3280c1bb88bf27f0b7aaee75498f7756454716e92c2025dce8c1f4933cecfcbd", "ja": "そっかー、残念。", "zh": "这样啊──真可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b049add93c43da6672dcd15c045fb609518315311a3b2014a8d6353100b3215d", "ja": "それより、他に何か気付いた事があれば\n聞いておきたいんだけど。何かあるか？", "zh": "话说回来，我还想听听是否有其他发现。\n还有其他感想吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "060e9a86beba9a5395d1d6037053a20203f6d4f55113e3a982f1d1e28d1e84ec", "ja": "ん～、えっとね！\nこの衣装、すっごく体動かしやすいんだよ！", "zh": "嗯～我想想！\n这套服装非常方便活动喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "dfa8cb83330ab005e0523acb6e8c0a2473471eff3a3ebb8af6d3dca1c92241b5", "ja": "あっ！　でもおしとやかにしてないと、\n今回の衣装のイメージっぽくない？　ダメ？", "zh": "啊！但如果不端庄一点，\n会不会跟这次服装的风格不合？这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2e7e2f7645276eaf32e242d6a449c2629f51bf51f74334a8a7f39178e6cb24ab", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。\n海美の思うとおり、思いっきり動いていい。", "zh": "没这回事。\n海美想怎么动就尽管动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "30243e38a69c7894feeb1b462324c6a0d283493e8801db38720553616e9ec5df", "ja": "ホント？　じゃあ本番でも、目いっぱい踊っちゃお☆\n……それにしても、美咲ちゃん遅いなー。まだかなー？", "zh": "真的吗？那等到正式上场，我要尽全力跳舞☆\n……话说回来，美咲好慢呀──还没好吗──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "17b13683cf67fd3f0278d051029cd7f498cb0da6e2787264ea938dc9d80522b0", "ja": "うう、じっとしてられないーっ！\n{$P$}、レッスンルーム空いてる？", "zh": "呜呜，我没办法静下来──！\n{$P$}，练习室是空的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ce12b5840542f30137a73a37f1851b2ff5fcf648e889c7e2f28b2920c531fb74", "ja": "いや、今はのり子達のレッスンが入ってた気が……。", "zh": "没有，现在好像是法子她们的练习时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "f49a5273fce4184f507bc8eb8cb528a3f5395313c3ecb9dd430a247174274487", "ja": "うぅ、どうしよう……。\n今すぐ動きたいのに……！", "zh": "呜呜，怎么办……\n我好想马上活动身体……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9fb73ecfc8e615a2ae61226bb00956f04a907da44738efeb011c828919a9b14b", "ja": "なら、柔軟はどうだ？\n衣装の調整にも、もってこいだ。", "zh": "那就做柔软操吧？\n也正好适合调整服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "9e1d4c726ed6938009982f8e8f6d72baa44bbe1f94679d32bf68fcdee5138e06", "ja": "おーっ、さすが{$P$}！\n柔軟いいね、やろうっ！", "zh": "哦──不愧是{$P$}！\n柔软操不错，我就来做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7396d9db26c82208fc1a6335c36d678927816b693c528529977d1f69dd579df", "ja": "{$P$}も、一緒にやろうよ！\n体動かすのって、気持ちいいよ～？", "zh": "{$P$}也一起做吧！\n活动身体会很舒服喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e2c5c4cbe7bb42eae2b312927df50906d5187e9926032a5b5c59e91f4fd23638", "ja": "そうだな、じゃあ付き合おうか……。\n肩こりの解消にもなりそうだし。", "zh": "也对，那就陪你吧……\n反正也能舒缓肩颈酸痛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0124_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "429eead1b40302d4476d3fce2df54842744d3b46bfb6722d1f98d2e9aa25a5e9", "ja": "私が、押したり引っ張ったりしてあげる！　えへへ、\nなんか、お姉ちゃんと一緒にやったのを思い出すな～♪", "zh": "我来帮你拉伸！\n嘿嘿，让我想起了跟姊姊一起做柔软操的时候呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
